			<a href="https://www.facebook.com/dialog/share?app_id=140586622674265&href=http://jccc.prestosports.com/sports/bsb/2025-26/releases/20260626jalf49" target="_blank" class="gicon-facebook" aria-label="Share JCCC baseball commit Maverick Garnder selected for the Native America All-Star Showcase in Atlanta to Facebook">Facebook</a>
		</div>
	
		
	                    <span class="leadin">The Atlanta Braves recently released the rosters for the fifth annual Native American All-Star Baseball Showcase, which will take place at Truist Park on Saturday, June 27 and Sunday June 28. Forty-seven of the top high school baseball players of Native American descent will participate, representing 32 tribes from across 19 states and Canada.</span>
        	
		</div>

    				    				
			</div>
			    		
    			
    			
    			
    			
    			
    		    
    			    			
    			
    			    			    			<div class="seat seat5 article">

    				    				<div class="media-box">
    				    							<div class="slide-img" data-url="/sports/bsb/2025-26/releases/20260625guwf3w" >
							
            <img src="data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIAAAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAAALAAAAAABAAEAAAIBRAA7" data-src="/sports/bsb/2025-26/photos/0001/Baseball-Coach-of-the-Year-Graphic.jpg?max_width=1600&useS3=true" alt="Promotional sports graphic featuring a side-profile photo of a bearded baseball coach wearing a white cap and blue jacket, positioned across the center. On the left, a dark blue patterned background displays a stylized yellow “JC” logo above bold white text reading “ERIC HORNER.” On the right, a light background includes the ABCA and ATEC logos above the headline “2026 D-I BASEBALL COACH OF THE YEAR” in blue and teal text, separated by thin gold lines." width="1600" height="750" />
    
</div>
    					    				        				</div>

    				    					<div class="story-box">
            <a href="/sports/bsb/2025-26/releases/20260625guwf3w" class="title" >JCCC's Eric Horner Named ABCA/ATEC NJCAA D-I Coach of the Year</a>
    
		
	
			<time datetime="2026-06-25T12:00" class="date">
					June 25, 2026
						</time>
	
			<div class="carousel-share-links">
			<a href="https://twitter.com/intent/tweet?text=JCCC's Eric Horner Named ABCA/ATEC NJCAA D-I Coach of the Year&url=http://jccc.prestosports.com/sports/bsb/2025-26/releases/20260625guwf3w&related=" target="_blank" class="gicon-twitter" aria-label="Share JCCC's Eric Horner Named ABCA/ATEC NJCAA D-I Coach of the Year to Twitter">Twitter</a>
			<a href="https://www.facebook.com/dialog/share?app_id=140586622674265&href=http://jccc.prestosports.com/sports/bsb/2025-26/releases/20260625guwf3w" target="_blank" class="gicon-facebook" aria-label="Share JCCC's Eric Horner Named ABCA/ATEC NJCAA D-I Coach of the Year to Facebook">Facebook</a>
		</div>
	
		
	                    <span class="leadin">Johnson County Community College head baseball coach Eric Horner has been named the 2026 NJCAA Division I National Coach of the Year by the American Baseball Coaches Association (ABCA) and ATEC. Earlier this week Horner was named the ABCA/ATEC Plains Region Coach of the Year for a fourth consecutive year. This is the first time he has been selected as the National Coach of the Year.</span>
        	
		</div>

    				    				
			</div>
			    			    			    			    			    			    			    			    			    			    			    			    			    			    			    			    			    			    			    			    			    			    			    			    			    			    			    			    			    			    			    			    			    			    			    			    			    			    			    			    			    			    			    			    			    			    			    			    			    			    			    			    			    			    			    			    			    			    			    			    			    			    			    			    			    			    			    			    			    			    			    			    			    			    			    			    			    			    			    			    			    			    			    			    			    			    			    			    			    			    			    			    			    			    			    			    			    			    			    			    			    			    			    			    			    			    			    			    			    			    			    			    			    			    			    			    			    			    			    			    			    			    			    			    			    			    			    			    			    			    			    			    			    			    			    			    			    			    			    			    			    			    			    			    			    			    			    			    			    			    			    			    			    			    			    			    			    			    			    			    			    			    			    			    			    			    			    			    			    			    			    			    			    			    			    			    			    			    			    			    			    			    			    			    			    			    			    			    			    			    			    			    			    			    			    			    			    			    			    			    			    			    			    			    			    			    			    			    			    			    			    			    			    			    			    			    			    			    			    			    			    			    			    			    			    			    			    			    			    			    			    			    			    			    			    			    			    			    			    			    			    			    			    			    			    			    			    			    			    			    			    			    			    			    			    			    			    			    			    			    			    			    			    			    			    			    			    			    			    			    			    			    			    			    			    			    			    			    			    			    			    			    			    			    			    			  